    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; \" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 13.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.62%; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 13.5pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"88%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Clinical criteria for recommending <em>TP53</em> germline testing</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.38%; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 13.5pt;\" width=\"11%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Reference(s)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 13.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.4%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 13.5pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Classic LFS criteria</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 13.5pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband with:</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.38%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 13.5pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"11%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{3409256}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 73.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 73.7pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a sarcoma diagnosed before the age of 45&nbsp;years <strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 45&nbsp;years <strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first- or second-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 45&nbsp;years or a sarcoma at any age</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 9.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.4%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" rowspan=\"5\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>LFS-like syndrome criteria</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Birch criteria</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.38%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" rowspan=\"5\" width=\"11%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{8118819; 8718514}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 9.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband with:</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 42.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 42.75pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>any childhood cancer or with a sarcoma, brain tumour, or adrenocortical carcinoma diagnosed before the age of 45&nbsp;years <strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first- or second-degree relative with a typical LFS cancer (sarcoma, breast cancer, brain tumour, adrenocortical carcinoma, or leukaemia) at any age <strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first- or second-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 60&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 9.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Eeles criteria</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Two first- or second-degree relatives with LFS-related malignancies at any age</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 9.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.4%; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" rowspan=\"8\" width=\"19%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Chompret criteria</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 15.1pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; page-break-after: avoid; \">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A proband with:</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.38%; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 9.75pt;\" rowspan=\"8\" width=\"11%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{11332399; 18511570; 19652052}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 83.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 83.2pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a tumour belonging to the LFS tumour spectrum (soft tissue sarcoma, osteosarcoma, premenopausal breast cancer, brain tumour, adrenocortical carcinoma, leukaemia, or bronchoalveolar lung cancer) before the age of 46&nbsp;years <strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; \"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>at least one first- or second-degree relative with an LFS tumour (except breast cancer if the proband has breast cancer) before the age of 56&nbsp;years or with multiple tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 1.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 1.95pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>OR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 1.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 1.95pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 15.1pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; \">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A proband with multiple tumours (except multiple breast tumours), two of which belong to the LFS tumour spectrum and the first of which occurred before the age of 46&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 1.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 1.95pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>OR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 1.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 1.95pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 15.1pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; \">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>A proband diagnosed with adrenocortical carcinoma or choroid plexus tumour, or anaplastic rhabdomyosarcoma of embryonal subtype, irrespective of family history</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 1.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 1.95pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>OR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.2%; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" width=\"69%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 15.1pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; \">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Breast cancer before the age of 31&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">LFS, Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome.</p>",
